{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"0b573e8d65c943a954bfcbb5f666716eff5efe07ddebfca0eafee1d16d4d2d9b","ja":"結局、風花はエレナと一緒にサンバを踊って……","zh":"结果，风花和艾莲娜一起跳了桑巴……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7b3f440b3c9ef0b84a03efa213cca4d7f40617395481a50190ea99c9fdd9ecbf","ja":"エヘヘ、やっぱり息ぴったりだったネ！\nみんなワタシたちのこと見てたヨ♪","zh":"嘿嘿，我们果然配合默契呢！\n大家都在看着我们哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"404fa39958f96fb91a8c93318435d10ed803d9a72a8aa18e82df724b9704c049","ja":"え、ええ。\nちょっと疲れたけど、とても楽しかったわね。","zh":"嗯、嗯。\n虽然有点累，但真的很开心呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"96111e5b05ba5da43d2effc090e20ad5364e8bd6bb618d464a578daf6ce69791","ja":"（……それにしても、私服でよかったんだ。\n私ったら、てっきり……）","zh":"（……话说回来，穿便服就可以了啊。\n我真是的，还以为……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"893e5c3ad5b89f7bff771bd74f5a401cf707dac84e993ee613e307529a058f54","ja":"はあ～……安心したら、\nなんだか力が抜けちゃった。","zh":"哈～……一安心下来，\n感觉整个人都没力气了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d7552c729c994d81deb82b6362707ad0a85de088d667784f62a2363f47cc8c12","ja":"ええっ！？\nそんなに緊張してたノ？","zh":"诶！？\n你之前有那么紧张吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7f300346ced3f194bb7fd072b28e2f5a55012e1a0585adef1771533da6b749ae","ja":"えっと……まあ、そうね……。","zh":"那个……嘛，也是呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"820afafb6de7576458c9df06d13b79aacb0dc31fde8f7f139f8b0999135b06bc","ja":"でも、エレナちゃんとサンバを踊るのは\nすごく楽しかったよ！　またやりたいくらい！","zh":"不过，和艾莲娜一起跳桑巴\n真的很开心哦！甚至还想再跳一次！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"87c4e533905a2787b56808b69dd0f16d36b62a4b5dde2e067848f0597ce3380d","ja":"ホント？　エヘヘ、うれしいナ♪\nワタシね、サンバが大好きだから……。","zh":"真的吗？嘿嘿，好开心呀♪\n我啊，最喜欢桑巴了，所以……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2b143fbcd370c23bce8154e471f107945ed40b375a639d40a5b18cee90abf4fb","ja":"今日はフーカにも、サンバのワクワクするカンジを\n体験してもらいたかったんダ♪","zh":"今天我也想让风花\n体验一下桑巴那种让人心潮澎湃的感觉呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9e382042b4a5000954f5be46949b131a5000faa576a74d3bf6303952a2ac7dad","ja":"そっか……私、ちゃんとは踊れなかったけど、\nサンバって明るくてすごく素敵だなって思ったよ♪","zh":"这样啊……虽然我没能跳得很好，\n但觉得桑巴舞充满活力，真的很棒呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2bb97bdb427fb67fd172364fbe0570b3a15ab16e5aac52cb8cec38c97945b890","ja":"エヘヘ、でしょ？　じゃあ次は……衣装で踊ろうヨ！\nサンバ衣装、まだ借りれるか聞きに行こう♪","zh":"嘿嘿，对吧？那下次……穿着服装跳吧！\n去问问看还能不能借到桑巴服装吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"baa1657fcfa496cba9a810486fc238665d0a16e14af3c834c93e50075a5d847c","ja":"……えっ！？　あ、あの。エレナちゃん？\n確かに楽しいとは言ったけど……。","zh":"……诶！？那个，艾莲娜？\n虽然我确实说过很开心就是了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4cbd790b61572372f0d7b2671e520fa9bb8e63f08293870def2acedbae93303c","ja":"さっきも息ぴったりだったし、大丈夫！\nワタシがまたリードするから、安心してネ！","zh":"刚才也配合得很默契，没问题的！\n我会继续带动节奏，放轻松吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1707.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a324d4dfb54e05d55e066dd8e549f05ad459ab21759b8478181d74aa84f9763a","ja":"サンバが不安なんじゃなくて、\nあ、あの衣装を着るのが……お、押さないで～っ！！","zh":"我不是对桑巴感到不安，\n而、而是穿那套服装有点……别、别推我啦～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
